{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INTRO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a rookie pilot on the outskirts of the galaxy you're thrown into combat as wildlife turns aggressive, and friends turn into foes. It's up to you and your team to fight your way through 15 campaign levels and discover what's causing this chaos. Will you rise to the occasion and save the universe or let it be consumed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liberate planets, earn credits, upgrade your ship, and kill challenging bosses. Mix and match weapons and mods to customize your play style. Play with up to 4 players to take on the Campaign or our Bounty system which offers an endless challenge and leader boards to show off your progress solo or as a team.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHIP FRAMES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1108250/extras/a4272ae7535307d242d58ab525603d80.poster.avif?t=1762235999\" width=516 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1108250/extras/a4272ae7535307d242d58ab525603d80.webm?t=1762235999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1108250/extras/a4272ae7535307d242d58ab525603d80.mp4?t=1762235999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one of four ship frames. The Attack Frame offers quick movement and access to up to two secondary weapons. The Bomber has the ability to launch devastating area of effect attacks and is the slowest but most durable frame. The Engineer Frame offers drone support that can increase your damage, or utility by healing to yourself and allies. Finally the Scout Frame is our fastest ship that makes clones of itself that can continue to dish out damage while you take evasive maneuvers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCOVER THE GALAXY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1108250/extras/0695d4b551518e3b2ec525baf01864ea.poster.avif?t=1762235999\" width=520 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1108250/extras/0695d4b551518e3b2ec525baf01864ea.webm?t=1762235999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1108250/extras/0695d4b551518e3b2ec525baf01864ea.mp4?t=1762235999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore diverse planets with unique enemies and challenges. From the depths of an alien ocean, to a vibrant neon city, you'll encounter all types of life and biomes in your journey to save the galaxy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1108250/extras/36619424ec8be39437c7fcc2fb0a6d65.poster.avif?t=1762235999\" width=516 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1108250/extras/36619424ec8be39437c7fcc2fb0a6d65.webm?t=1762235999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1108250/extras/36619424ec8be39437c7fcc2fb0a6d65.mp4?t=1762235999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get loot, earn credits, purchase weapons, mods, and push the limits of what your Frame can do. Reroll affixes, and upgrade items to legendary status to reach their full potential.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BATTLE BOSSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1108250/extras/ea9ee90f6d3ea70e499ab4c73b27a82d.poster.avif?t=1762235999\" width=512 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1108250/extras/ea9ee90f6d3ea70e499ab4c73b27a82d.webm?t=1762235999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1108250/extras/ea9ee90f6d3ea70e499ab4c73b27a82d.mp4?t=1762235999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in combat with giant bosses that will test the limits of your abilities. Each campaign and bounty level will sport a boss for you to fight at the end. They will put your skills to the test, and offer giant loot spoils when killed. Good luck!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MULTIPLAYER AND BOUNTIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1108250/extras/7eee3a9a647c44689ef97ce2bf45ca98.poster.avif?t=1762235999\" width=516 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1108250/extras/7eee3a9a647c44689ef97ce2bf45ca98.webm?t=1762235999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1108250/extras/7eee3a9a647c44689ef97ce2bf45ca98.mp4?t=1762235999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 4 players to take on the Campaign or our end game Bounty system. This system allows you to push the limits and test your metal against others around the world. Each level of our Bounty system will get increasingly harder and offer more challenges each level you go up. From harder hitting enemies, to stronger and more diverse foes. Will you have what it takes to reach the top of the leader boards?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"All Systems Operational!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1108250/60a86845bc749a10e3e025034f0c9256fa240b89.jpg"},{"name":"Corrupted Forest Cleansed!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1108250/7347d2623fd5a95562c07401ca64886167a00bb5.jpg"},{"name":"Crystal Ruins Polished!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1108250/c71fe895bcc55faa7e9eec4278d3ea782750bc27.jpg"},{"name":"Deep Forest Investigated!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1108250/ab4f6eb29b9d5ff86cc43414f6fcf81934f21b3f.jpg"},{"name":"The Spice Must Flow!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1108250/980eb91c435145265a62f43e373ae15a72c91cc1.jpg"},{"name":"Swim With The Fishes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1108250/f77091d4aad1b0e7e252c15dde4c2e15297e60b2.jpg"},{"name":"Not So Endless","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1108250/5deb0f6b3c16d7ff3001c064f2d5e886f2406d2c.jpg"},{"name":"Spooky Scary Skeletons","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1108250/ac0d6a559a71053abc9f5af5c7054924ddbaf6f6.jpg"},{"name":"Pickup Your Room!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1108250/a7f6f2b8b4983a8701dd97e65c026eb2f0b4d3fe.jpg"},{"name":"Encounter at Farpoint","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1108250/d638dd5a4d2b64b584208eea0b6a83a48319f0e2.jpg"}],"total":16},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1108250?t=1762235999","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1108250/7db1b025360b7e56f5e7c02a3ccb98012c7a1169/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762235999","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1108250/188a8e2d2c986e155cca172671556388747c2795/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762235999","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1108250/188a8e2d2c986e155cca172671556388747c2795/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762235999","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":1208650,"description":"Free Demo"}],"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD COMMUNITY</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1108250/extras/5481143b1e640ced8537aaea09616c46.avif?t=1762235999\" width=1295 height=183 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite Code:\u00a0F9aRWT4sS4</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INTRO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a rookie pilot on the outskirts of the galaxy you're thrown into combat as wildlife turns aggressive, and friends turn into foes. It's up to you and your team to fight your way through 15 campaign levels and discover what's causing this chaos. Will you rise to the occasion and save the universe or let it be consumed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liberate planets, earn credits, upgrade your ship, and kill challenging bosses. Mix and match weapons and mods to customize your play style. Play with up to 4 players to take on the Campaign or our Bounty system which offers an endless challenge and leader boards to show off your progress solo or as a team.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHIP FRAMES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline p