tag\" >CUSTOMIZE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1108250/extras/36619424ec8be39437c7fcc2fb0a6d65.poster.avif?t=1762235999\" width=516 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1108250/extras/36619424ec8be39437c7fcc2fb0a6d65.webm?t=1762235999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1108250/extras/36619424ec8be39437c7fcc2fb0a6d65.mp4?t=1762235999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get loot, earn credits, purchase weapons, mods, and push the limits of what your Frame can do. Reroll affixes, and upgrade items to legendary status to reach their full potential.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BATTLE BOSSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1108250/extras/ea9ee90f6d3ea70e499ab4c73b27a82d.poster.avif?t=1762235999\" width=512 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1108250/extras/ea9ee90f6d3ea70e499ab4c73b27a82d.webm?t=1762235999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1108250/extras/ea9ee90f6d3ea70e499ab4c73b27a82d.mp4?t=1762235999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in combat with giant bosses that will test the limits of your abilities. Each campaign and bounty level will sport a boss for you to fight at the end. They will put your skills to the test, and offer giant loot spoils when killed. Good luck!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MULTIPLAYER AND BOUNTIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1108250/extras/7eee3a9a647c44689ef97ce2bf45ca98.poster.avif?t=1762235999\" width=516 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1108250/extras/7eee3a9a647c44689ef97ce2bf45ca98.webm?t=1762235999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1108250/extras/7eee3a9a647c44689ef97ce2bf45ca98.mp4?t=1762235999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 4 players to take on the Campaign or our end game Bounty system. This system allows you to push the limits and test your metal against others around the world. Each level of our Bounty system will get increasingly harder and offer more challenges each level you go up. From harder hitting enemies, to stronger and more diverse foes. Will you have what it takes to reach the top of the leader boards?</p>","developers":["Seatoad LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1108250/79b70cf14563f83d7834c20fe01609c2b781241b/header.jpg?t=1762235999","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.12+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card with DX10 (shader model 4.0) capabilities.<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1108250/2028228972/10407059620d5d2dd7adb60a9e409e9734c74399/1761295982/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761316466","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1108250/2028228972/10407059620d5d2dd7adb60a9e409e9734c74399/1761295982/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761316